% Internal topology framework.
% To add a topology, first reset only that topology's private defaults, then
% declare stable slot coordinates such as corrC, corrUL, or corrBoxTopLeft.
% Draw propagators through \corr@topologydrawprop, place labels and vertices
% through the topology helpers below, and keep public keys mapped to slots.
% Future one-loop box target: four corner interaction vertices, four internal
% propagators forming a box, four diagonal external legs carrying q_1, q_2,
% q_3, q_4, edge momenta k, q_1+k, q_1+k-q_4, q_2-k, and a central loop
% arrow labeled k. This should be built from the helpers here before exposing
% any public rotatable sub-3-point primitive.
\newcommand{\corr@topologydrawprop}[4]{%
